    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RTS, but the recruited soldiers will act automatically:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each soldier has different characteristics/attribute values/action methods. As the lord of the castle, the player chooses the appropriate soldiers and buildings, manages the economy/defense/attack, and destroys the opponent's castle only through your strategy rather than operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the map you want to play: different terrain, map size, resource richness, distance between camps, etc. will bring different gaming experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely adjust the difficulty: simply suppress the enemy, fight evenly, or take on the most difficult challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the campaign alone/two-player on-screen battle/LAN online battle, try to destroy castles everywhere in different modes, and win the castle war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks for Pixel Art &lt;Tiny Swords&gt; UwU</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RTS, but the recruited soldiers will act automatically:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each soldier has different characteristics/attribute values/action methods. As the lord of the castle, the player chooses the appropriate soldiers and buildings, manages the economy/defense/attack, and destroys the opponent's castle only through your strategy rather than operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the map you want to play: different terrain, map size, resource richness, distance between camps, etc. will bring different gaming experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely adjust the difficulty: simply suppress the enemy, fight evenly, or take on the most difficult challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the campaign alone/two-player on-screen battle/LAN online battle, try to destroy castles everywhere in different modes, and win the castle war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks for Pixel Art &lt;Tiny Swords&gt; UwU</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "RTS, but the soldiers will act automatically: Each soldier has different characteristics/attribute values/action methods. Choose the appropriate soldiers and buildings according to the battlefield situation, and destroy the opponent's castle only through your strategy rather than operation!",
